u please add Parents evening to my calendar for next friday at 10:30?\", \"Would you kindly mark the Cancel task as done? I've finished it.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-013\", \"v\": [[\"Can you move my Choir appointment to tuesday?\", \"No wait, make it monday instead.\"], [\"umm could you shift the Choir thing over to tuesday for me?\", \"oh no sorry, actually I meant monday, can we do monday?\"], [\"Would you mind moving the Choir appointment to tuesday, please?\", \"My apologies, could you make that monday instead?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-014\", \"v\": [[\"delete all meal plan notes\"], [\"Could you please delete all of my meal plan notes?\"], [\"right so um, can you just get rid of every one of my meal plan notes? all of them\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-015\", \"v\": [[\"show me jolene wetherby's contact pls\", \"whats my plan for tomorrow, earliest first\"], [\"Jolene Wetherby contact card\", \"tomorrow's plan, earliest first\"], [\"Can you show me Jolene Wetherby's contact card?\", \"What's on for tomorrow, starting with the earliest?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-016\", \"v\": [[\"What did I last talk about with Niamh Oyelowo?\", \"Can you find everything that mentions Oduya?\", \"Which to-dos are due this week?\", \"Just the weekend ones?\", \"Can you move the watch task to sunday?\"], [\"Could you tell me what I last discussed with Niamh Oyelowo?\", \"Would you mind finding everything that mentions Oduya?\", \"Could you tell me which of my tasks are due this week?\", \"Could you narrow those down to just the weekend ones, please?\", \"Would you please move the watch task to sunday?\"], [\"umm what was the last thing me and Niamh Oyelowo talked about, do you know?\", \"oh different thing, could you dig up anything at all mentioning Oduya?\", \"and um, what to-dos have I got due this week, roughly?\", \"hmm can you just give me the weekend ones out of those?\", \"oh and while I remember, could you shift that watch task over to sunday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-017\", \"v\": [[\"umm could y